				<r3d:description language="eng">The European Union Clinical Trials Register allows you to search for protocol and results information on interventional clinical trials that are conducted in the European Union (EU) and the European Economic Area (EEA) and clinical trials conducted outside the EU / EEA that are linked to European paediatric-medicine development. The EU Clinical Trials Register is part of EudraPharm, which is the community database of authorised medicinal products. The website provides public access to information extracted from the  European Union Drug Regulating Authorities Clinical Trials Database, EudraCT.</r3d:description>
